{
"dur": 57.052,
"shots": [
{
"i": 1,
"start": 0.0,
"vo_start": 0.6,
"vo_end": 4.439,
"text": "So the plan was to catch him with the laptop open, logged in as Roberts.",
"end": 4.714
},
{
"i": 2,
"start": 4.714,
"vo_start": 4.989,
"vo_end": 10.989,
"text": "On the afternoon of the first of October, 2013, Ross walked into the Glen Park branch of the San Francisco Public Library.",
"end": 11.264
},
{
"i": 3,
"start": 11.264,
"vo_start": 11.539,
"vo_end": 15.419,
"text": "He sat at a table by the window and opened his laptop on the free Wi-Fi.",
"end": 15.694
},
{
"i": 4,
"start": 15.694,
"vo_start": 15.969,
"vo_end": 19.527,
"text": "Around him, agents dressed as ordinary library users waited.",
"end": 19.802
},
{
"i": 5,
"start": 19.802,
"vo_start": 20.077,
"vo_end": 27.394,
"text": "Outside, an undercover Homeland Security agent who had worked his way onto Silk Road's staff chatted with Roberts and asked him to check something on the site.",
"end": 27.669
},
{
"i": 6,
"start": 27.669,
"vo_start": 27.944,
"vo_end": 29.27,
"text": "Ross logged in.",
"end": 29.545
},
{
"i": 7,
"start": 29.545,
"vo_start": 29.82,
"vo_end": 33.214,
"text": "Behind him, two agents posing as a couple started a loud argument.",
"end": 33.489
},
{
"i": 8,
"start": 33.489,
"vo_start": 33.764,
"vo_end": 34.803,
"text": "Ross turned to look.",
"end": 35.079
},
{
"i": 9,
"start": 35.079,
"vo_start": 35.354,
"vo_end": 41.073,
"text": "In that second, an agent slid the open laptop away and passed it to a colleague. It was still unlocked.",
"end": 41.348
},
{
"i": 10,
"start": 41.348,
"vo_start": 41.623,
"vo_end": 44.863,
"text": "On the screen, he was logged in to an account called mastermind.",
"end": 45.138
},
{
"i": 11,
"start": 45.138,
"vo_start": 45.413,
"vo_end": 50.272,
"text": "He was handcuffed among the bookshelves. Silk Road was taken offline the next day.",
"end": 50.547
},
{
"i": 12,
"start": 50.547,
"vo_start": 50.822,
"vo_end": 56.102,
"text": "On the laptop, agents found his journal, records of the business, and about 144,000 bitcoins.",
"end": 57.052
}
],
